#: 1c0e7a843fa84003a007ff3a9a610dbc afa013ee69754c1bad8ed89ee0930445
#: bac1d6e1bd2840a7acbd26dfd8a5dee2 bf52ff7aa4c542ca92529cc731f93961
#: d2f8e0249b1946f3b4cb9789541878f6 eca3b68c66414589a8fba5a964cb2447
#: f0228dd8f8a94d21aff2e7084a5b04c5 f4d33ff6b38b476681a7904c0bd286b8
msgid "Autopilot Output Functions"
msgstr "飞控输出功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:7
#: 1a5c1782f96643beb9770dbba8ae9751 23b84f3a620b48eba912495df81b2f92
#: 34b7f445752a4a6d8a81b4137a0fe27b 5da97548d9884690a57c4d91f8d22b1e
#: 5ee7000aabc54f2e85f0aba0496554b0 e75ec00adbe54f178817ba08a3ed6443
#: f21593867f4349b5a5f85bd76b99fff9 f8cf19a9c2534c47bc7fead4ab6a1f49
msgid ""
"All autopilot servo/motor outputs may be mapped to any output function "
"supported by ArduPilot. This page describes how to configure these output "
"channels and what each of the available functions that can be assigned to an"
" output are."
msgstr "所有飞控舵机/电机输出均可映射到 ArduPilot 支持的任意输出功能。本页介绍如何配置这些输出通道，以及可分配给输出的各个可用功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:11
#: 02826b4ff4c6438db747ceebf5c045f1 0d19869526884995973b91bb5c7bc7e3
#: 226055dadeed4d809172f96c12e67945 2c55d25582b84ed8b12835a031ba46f4
#: 3f89c3ba6ab24eb4b91c8741b52b76e4 aab0de1ed35a41fcaaecef976d22d486
#: d8b7864cfc3c4b48960e6436f661c912 dbeae15fc098484e8b4d50ec67fc3403
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to 32 outputs. These may be via DroneCAN ESCs or "
"directly from autopilot outputs, or a mixture of both."
msgstr "ArduPilot 最多支持32路输出。这些输出可通过 DroneCAN ESC 或直接通过飞控输出，或两者混合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:13
#: 20a728d4b09b41e0b4e7b98fbe0ee7f2 2eb9a375055f4df8bbc9e00f6b033f61
#: 374f29c1e8234c2d95332439f6aa7cec 46c7bad19e0743ebbb9848e16273cee1
#: 64b1273010174ec5bcd8a759493ee1f7 9a822e81f3354ccea2f2a856c490b52b
#: b38cb1c2a70c467097571e4c4c2b9dfe b4475d1db0344ffbac2bbfded47ce15d
msgid ""
"See the left sidebar menu for major output categories to navigate to desired"
" functions on this page quickly."
msgstr "请查看左侧边栏菜单中的主要输出类别，以快速导航到本页所需功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:18
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:20
#: 3bf191c6d4c74d5f825f068411802cab 5d688e03162e4f7186be10eca06baae5
#: 74be08b6b50e4b0597c9d9df88671f99 7804297ea00849b3b81bcd8f04074cfb
#: 8fd188655d4f4ceab9c4d5fce9fb958d 9a6383fa9afd47b0b3f2be71337848aa
#: d0585fe0306543a0a34a0c819fa271dd f098ebd730fd4798a1a232595565f872
msgid "The SERVOn_FUNCTION parameters"
msgstr "SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:20
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:22
#: 2d039fc836ca4991b77cd2c2ac490ff5 60cdb9e2c09b499c8695f6e1d786ef60
#: 64b7332242b8440897a8120669d141e8 adc3040cdf004e8896b3bc5bf6fd090c
#: be737893db5c43bebd9feaa9f5d457fd c3f1fa5c12384efc88b9305a0e453c85
#: d179fb2936594793ab65184da0fe74bb f26e2016b0e84eddbe773242ae7003c3
msgid ""
"In the advanced parameter view of your GCS you will find that each SERVO "
"output channel has a ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` parameter. For example, "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>`  controls the output function of "
"channel 5, :ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` controls the output "
"function of channel 6 and so on."
msgstr ""
"在地面站的高级参数视图中，每个 SERVO 输出通道都有一个 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` "
"参数。例如，:ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` "
"控制通道5的输出功能，:ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` 控制通道6的输出功能，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:25
#: 0711fc8e83e3460d80ccfd7a38cb45e1 284cecccc74742fa9b68c1ce3b1ce3d6
#: 3edee64732a64c4f9cf162fd85b7b86b 47aa9c698660404d92f84387e43ee674
#: b4b805f757804ee0aa0d5149ddb84398 ce80ae56f1c541be93fae91dc9da9945
#: db39535463dd46868e0b9ca9243be798 ec4a03b3578043efa3fed04a6946df9c
msgid ""
"Not all the functions are available in each vehicle. Defaults are set to 0 "
"when firmware for a vehicle type is first loaded. Choosing a frame "
"configuration in Mission Planner during initial setup will set the outputs "
"to the basic typical functions for that frame type. For example, fixed wing "
"plane will set the first four outputs, SERVO1-SERVO4 to Aileron, Elevator, "
"Throttle, and Rudder functions, respectively."
msgstr ""
"并非所有功能在每种机型中都可用。首次加载某机型固件时，默认值设为0。在初始设置期间，在 Mission Planner "
"中选择机架配置将把输出设置为该机架类型的典型基本功能。例如，固定翼飞机会将前四路输出 SERVO1-SERVO4 "
"分别设为副翼、升降舵、油门和方向舵功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:27
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:29
#: 2941b212e5b647808dddd85d3cbac54e 39427ba058724dc9b7db37776d5cd3e9
#: 4489708ddd4644ecac38fe780108a845 5234710c6857426f86877e95eb021e99
#: 5ba493a94a3e4e0a9b348d7693910554 6554002b189844e98e3e5aaafe33c0a0
#: aaf4c107a0d942568bd0317ec9588660 c39801df44a34981a1e3af9a05447bf0
msgid ""
"All of these functions may be used on multiple channels. So if you want 3 "
"elevator channels for some reason you can set ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` to 19 on 3"
" of your output channels."
msgstr ""
"所有这些功能都可在多个通道上使用。因此，如果您出于某种原因需要3路升降舵通道，可以在3个输出通道上将 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` 设为19。"

