#: 0a90b90a82944643937b66a330627a90 49bd41293cce44c1b4ebf981b952c273
#: 808ba19a2d624b2e8cb5ca2bb5a26e86 82f701417f4d476c99688fcfc8da7936
#: 97871cd42b2d40ecbf561d5a65cb2910 d35a985a3c474e24961de2c9fa17ff77
msgid ""
"In Plane, these outputs are for differential thrust in twin engine aircraft "
"and the amount of yaw affecting the base throttle value is determined by "
":ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>`. Also, in Plane's vectored Tailsitters, "
"these are the motor outputs. In Rover, these outputs are for control of the "
"steering motors in :ref:`Skid-Steering Rovers <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration-skid>`. In Copter, these outputs are used for the Bicopter "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 中，这些输出用于双发飞机的差动推力，偏航对基础油门值的影响程度由 :ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>` "
"决定。此外，在 Plane 的矢量尾座式机型（vectored Tailsitter）中，这些是电机输出。在 Rover 中，这些输出用于 "
":ref:`滑移转向车 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-skid>` 的转向电机控制。在 Copter "
"中，这些输出用于 Bicopter 的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:344
#: 4c193c6ae86c454bab8c1eadc3587a4f
msgid "In Copter, these outputs are used for the Bicopter motors."
